{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name='description' content='Connect with a licensed clinician for steady, compassionate support and an ongoing membership for private practice therapy.'>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f6efe6;--card:#fff7ef;--muted:#6b6b63;--accent:#8b5e3c;--accent-2:#b07a52;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;line-height:1.45;color:#2b2b27;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#efe7db)}
    header{position:sticky;top:0;backdrop-filter:saturate(120%) blur(6px);background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.62),rgba(255,255,255,0.48));border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);z-index:40}
    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:1rem}
    nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)}
    .nav-links{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .nav-links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:.45rem .6rem;border-radius:6px;font-size:.95rem}
    .nav-links a[href$='contact.html']{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:2rem auto;padding:1rem}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem;align-items:center;margin-bottom:1rem}
    .hero .card{background:var(--card);padding:1.25rem;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(83,56,40,0.06)}
    h1{margin:.15rem 0;font-size:1.6rem;color:#2e2b28}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:1rem;margin-top:1rem}
    .panel{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03)}
    label{display:block;margin-top:.5rem;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type='text'],input[type='email'],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:.6rem;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);margin-top:.25rem}
    button.btn{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:0;padding:.6rem .9rem;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}
    footer{max-width:980px;margin:2rem auto;padding:1rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem}
    .meta{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:.5rem}
    /* reveal */
    [data-reveal]{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity .55s ease,var(--tx,.45s) .45s ease,transform .55s cubic-bezier(.22,.9,.26,1)}
    [data-reveal].revealed{opacity:1;transform:none}
    /* session planner */
    .planner{border-radius:10px;padding:1rem;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),rgba(255,255,255,0.92));border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}
    .field-row{display:flex;gap:.5rem}
    .field-row > *{flex:1}
    .summary{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#fff;padding:.75rem;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed rgba(0,0,0,0.05);margin-top:.6rem}
    .small{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted)}
    .svg-bg{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;right:0;height:320px;pointer-events:none;opacity:.28}
    @media (max-width:820px){.columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .svg-bg{height:220px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- decorative pattern SVG -->
  <svg class='svg-bg' aria-hidden='true' preserveAspectRatio='none' viewBox='0 0 1200 320'>
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id='g1' x1='0' x2='1'>
        <stop offset='0' stop-color='#efe2d6' />
        <stop offset='1' stop-color='#f6efe6' />
      </linearGradient>
      <pattern id='p1' x='0' y='0' width='80' height='80' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'>
        <rect width='80' height='80' fill='url(#g1)'></rect>
        <path d='M0 40 Q20 20 40 40 T80 40' fill='none' stroke='#e1cfc1' stroke-width='2' opacity='0.9'></path>
        <circle cx='12' cy='12' r='2.5' fill='#d7b79a' opacity='.95'></circle>
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width='1200' height='320' fill='url(#p1)'></rect>
  </svg>

  <header>
    <div class='wrap'>
      <nav>
        <div class='brand'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div class='nav-links' aria-label='Primary'>
          <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
          <a href='about.html'>Who I am</a>
          <a href='specialties.html'>Offerings</a>
          <a href='approach.html'>How I work</a>
          <a href='fees.html'>Investment</a>
          <a href='faq.html'>Q&A</a>
          <a href='book.html'>Schedule</a>
          <a href='contact.html'>Get in touch</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class='hero' aria-labelledby='contact-heading'>
      <div class='card' data-reveal>
        <h1 id='contact-heading'>Reach out for a thoughtful, private conversation</h1>
        <p class='lead'>I offer an ongoing membership model of care for people seeking steady support through transitions and daily strain. Use this page to tell me about your needs or to try a brief planning tool below.</p>
        <p class='muted'>Phone: <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' class='small'>{{PHONE}}</a> • Email: <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' class='small'>{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class='columns'>
      <div>
        <section class='panel' data-reveal>
          <h2>Contact form</h2>
          <p class='small muted'>A private note to begin: I respond within a few business days. Please include availability and a brief sense of goals.</p>
          <form id='contactForm' onsubmit='return false;'>
            <label for='name'>Your name</label>
            <input id='name' name='name' type='text' placeholder='First and last'>
            <label for='email'>Email</label>
            <input id='email' name='email' type='email' placeholder='you@domain.com'>
            <label for='phone'>Phone (optional)</label>
            <input id='phone' name='phone' type='text' placeholder='Optional phone'>
            <label for='message'>Short message</label>
            <textarea id='message' name='message' rows='5' placeholder='What brings you here? What would you like to address?'></textarea>
            <div style='display:flex;gap:.5rem;margin-top:.75rem;align-items:center'>
              <button class='btn' id='sendBtn'>Prepare email</button>
              <div class='small muted'>Use the button to build a plaintext email summary you can paste into your own email client.</div>
            </div>
          </form>
        </section>

        <section class='panel' style='margin-top:1rem' data-reveal>
          <h3>Confidentiality & scope</h3>
          <p class='small muted'>Sessions are confidential except as required by law (e.g., risk of harm, court order). This service is clinical and supportive; it does not provide emergency crisis care. If you are in immediate danger or need urgent help, call local emergency services or your crisis line.</p>
        </section>

        <section class='panel' style='margin-top:1rem' data-reveal>
          <h3>Quick notes on membership</h3>
          <p class='small muted'>I offer a membership-style model for ongoing therapy, which includes regular sessions and access to short check-ins. Pricing and structure are discussed during an initial consult. There are no guarantees of outcomes — my role is to support you with evidence-informed approaches and steady collaboration.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- Session Planner #1 -->
        <section class='panel planner' style='margin-top:1rem' data-reveal>
          <h3>Session Planner</h3>
          <p class='small muted'>A brief interactive tool to sketch a plan you can bring to a first conversation.</p>
          <div style='margin-top:.6rem'>
            <label class='small'>Primary concern<label>
            <input id='planner1-concern' type='text' placeholder='e.g., anxiety about work, relationship strain'>
            <div class='field-row' style='margin-top:.5rem'>
              <div>
                <label class='small'>Preferred tempo</label>
                <select id='planner1-frequency'>
                  <option>Weekly</option>
                  <option>Biweekly</option>
                  <option>Monthly</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class='small'>Session length</label>
                <select id='planner1-length'>
                  <option>50 minutes</option>
                  <option>30 minutes</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <label class='small' style='margin-top:.5rem'>What matters most (one line)</label>
            <input id='planner1-goal' type='text' placeholder='The change you hope to see'>
            <div style='display:flex;gap:.5rem;margin-top:.6rem'>
              <button class='btn' id='planner1-build'>Build plan</button>
              <button class='btn' id='planner1-copy' type='button'>Copy summary</button>
            </div>
            <div class='summary' id='planner1-summary' aria-live='polite'></div>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class='panel' data-reveal>
          <h3>Quick logistics</h3>
          <p class='muted small'>Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
          <p class='muted small'>Email: <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
          <p class='muted small'>Phone: <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a></p>
          <p style='margin-top:.6rem' class='small muted'>If you'd like a clearer picture of fees and membership options, use the Session Planner below to summarize what you want to prioritize.</p>
        </div>

        <div class='panel' style='margin-top:1rem' data-reveal>
          <h3>Testimonials</h3>
          <p class='small muted'>"A steady guide through a hard change — practical and compassionate." — Client</p>
          <p class='small muted'>"Helpful weekly rhythms that fit a busy life." — Client</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Session Planner #2 (compact) -->
        <div class='panel planner' style='margin-top:1rem' data-reveal>
          <h4>Quick Plan</h4>
          <label class='small'>One-sentence aim</label>
          <input id='planner2-goal' type='text' placeholder='Gain clarity about next steps'>
          <label class='small' style='margin-top:.4rem'>Frequency</label>
          <select id='planner2-frequency'>
            <option>Weekly</option>
            <option>Biweekly</option>
            <option>Monthly</option>
          </select>
          <div style='display:flex;gap:.5rem;margin-top:.6rem'>
            <button class='btn' id='planner2-build'>Make</button>
            <button class='btn' id='planner2-copy' type='button'>Copy</button>
          </div>
          <div class='summary' id='planner2-summary'></div>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </div>

    <section class='panel' style='margin-top:1rem' data-reveal>
      <h3>Scope & Crisis notice</h3>
      <p class='small muted'>Therapy focuses on emotional and behavioral support. If you are experiencing a life-threatening crisis, please call emergency services immediately or your local crisis line. This site and contact form are not for emergencies.</p>
    </section>

    <section style='margin-top:1rem' data-reveal>
      <div class='panel' style='display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem'>
        <div>
          <h3 style='margin:.2rem 0'>Ready to talk?</h3>
          <p class='muted small'>If you prefer, schedule a first consult directly.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' aria-label='{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class='wrap'>
      <div class='meta'>
        <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • Licensed clinician • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        <div style='margin-top:.4rem'>Privacy: communications are treated with clinical confidentiality within professional limits.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Accessible scroll reveal
    (function(){
      var prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      var nodes = document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]');
      if(prefersReduced){
        nodes.forEach(function(n){n.classList.add('revealed')});
        return;
      }
      var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){
        entries.forEach(function(entry){
          if(entry.isIntersecting){
            entry.target.classList.add('revealed');
            io.unobserve(entry.target);
          }
        });
      },{threshold:0.12});
      nodes.forEach(function(n){io.observe(n)});
    })();

    // Contact form: build a plaintext email summary to paste into your client
    document.getElementById('sendBtn').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim() || '[Name]';
      var email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim() || '{{EMAIL}}';
      var phone = document.getElementById('phone').value.trim() || 'N/A';
      var msg = document.getElementById('message').value.trim() || '[Message]';
      var out = 'To: ' + '{{EMAIL}}' + '\nSubject: New contact — ' + name + '\n\n' + 'Name: ' + name + '\nEmail: ' + email + '\nPhone: ' + phone + '\n\nMessage:\n' + msg + '\n\n--\nSent from site contact form.';
      // create temporary textarea
      var ta = document.createElement('textarea'); ta.value = out; document.body.appendChild(ta); ta.select();
      try{document.execCommand('copy'); alert('Plaintext summary copied to clipboard. Paste into your email client to send.');}
      catch(e){alert('Copy failed — you can manually paste the prepared text.');}
      ta.remove();
    });

    // Session Planner logic (two independent instances)
    function buildPlan(values){
      var parts = [];
      parts.push('Session Plan Summary');
      parts.push('--------------------');
      if(values.concern) parts.push('Primary concern: ' + values.concern);
      if(values.goal) parts.push('One-line aim: ' + values.goal);
      if(values.frequency) parts.push('Recommended tempo: ' + values.frequency);
      if(values.length) parts.push('Session length: ' + values.length);
      if(values.notes) parts.push('Notes: ' + values.notes);
      parts.push('\nNext steps: Bring this plan to an initial consult. I will listen, clarify priorities, and we will consider options together.');
      parts.push('\n--\nThis is a preparatory plan, not a treatment contract.');
      return parts.join('\n');
    }

    // Planner 1
    document.getElementById('planner1-build').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var values = {
        concern: document.getElementById('planner1-concern').value.trim(),
        goal: document.getElementById('planner1-goal').value.trim(),
        frequency: document.getElementById('planner1-frequency').value,
        length: document.getElementById('planner1-length').value
      };
      var summary = buildPlan(values);
      var outEl = document.getElementById('planner1-summary');
      outEl.textContent = summary;
    });
    document.getElementById('planner1-copy').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var text = document.getElementById('planner1-summary').textContent.trim();
      if(!text){alert('Build a plan first.'); return}
      if(navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText){
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function(){alert('Plan copied to clipboard.')});
      } else {
        var ta = document.createElement('textarea'); ta.value = text; document.body.appendChild(ta); ta.select(); try{document.execCommand('copy'); alert('Plan copied.')}catch(e){alert('Copy failed.')} ta.remove();
      }
    });

    // Planner 2 (compact)
    document.getElementById('planner2-build').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var values = {
        concern: '',
        goal: document.getElementById('planner2-goal').value.trim(),
        frequency: document.getElementById('planner2-frequency').value,
        length: ''
      };
      var summary = buildPlan(values);
      document.getElementById('planner2-summary').textContent = summary;
    });
    document.getElementById('planner2-copy').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var text = document.getElementById('planner2-summary').textContent.trim();
      if(!text){alert('Make a quick plan first.'); return}
      if(navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText){
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function(){alert('Plan copied to clipboard.')});
      } else {
        var ta = document.createElement('textarea'); ta.value = text; document.body.appendChild(ta); ta.select(); try{document.execCommand('copy');alert('Plan copied.')}catch(e){alert('Copy failed.')} ta.remove();
      }
    });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for the private practice therapist template (chunk 4).

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html — The contact page and two embedded Session Planner widgets. Includes an accessible scroll-triggered reveal and an inline decorative SVG pattern.

Notable features:
- Two independent Session Planner widgets that generate a plaintext summary and support copying to clipboard. These are client-side only (no submission endpoint).
- Scroll-triggered section reveal using IntersectionObserver; respects prefers-reduced-motion and reveals sections immediately if reduction is requested.
- A contact form that prepares a plaintext email summary you can paste into your email client.
- No external assets or CDNs. The visual pattern is embedded inline via SVG in contact.html.

Placeholders present (do not replace in this bundle):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Accessibility notes:
- Motion reduction honored via matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').
- Planner summaries use aria-live for polite updates.

Content notes (clinician-oriented):
- Includes confidentiality, scope, and crisis notice language. Avoids medical claims and guarantees.

How to preview:
- Open contact.html in a modern browser (Chrome, Firefox, Safari). The page is static and runs the interactive features entirely in the browser.

If you need the assets/svg file referenced elsewhere in the project, check other chunks of the build for assets/img/pattern.svg."}
BUNDLE_END
